"Hello," you replied.
"May I sit?"
"Yes, please.”
There were plenty of vacant tables, so you concluded that the man wanted to talk. But you needed some privacy to think over the situation you were in. In the meantime the waitress brought your tea. You drank it down in almost one gulp and hurried to leave the table because a great idea to read about werewolves on the internet had suddenly come to your mind. You went outside the bar and took the cell phone off your neck.  This is what you managed to find: a person can become a werewolf not only after a bite. If one puts a wolf pelt on one’s back and reads a certain spell, he can become a werewolf. A werewolf is a very strong and sly creature. The best way to defeat it is to drive a hawthorn stake through its body. 
You recollected that a few days ago you visited the country home of an acquaintance of yours. And you actually tried a wolf pelt on there…
You decided to take rest in the neighboring grove and in the evening go visit the scoundrel who had put a spell on you.  You hid in the shrubs and fell asleep, lulled by the peaceful buzzing of bees. When your dreams released you, it was already dark. You were starving. You left your shelter and noticed the philosopher leave the bar.